<title>AUSTRALIA: RTRS-Austin Group slips to year net loss.</title>
<headline>RTRS-Austin Group slips to year net loss.</headline>
<dateline>MELBOURNE 1996-09-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year to June 30</p>
<p>		 (million A$ unless stated)</p>
